.svelte-kit/

# The generated OpenAPI client is COMMITTED on purpose. Gitignoring it meant a
# fresh checkout had no `paths`/`components` types at all, every API call
# type-checked as `never`, and CI muted the resulting ~110 svelte-check errors.
# Committing it makes the client a reviewable artifact and lets CI diff a fresh
# regeneration against it to catch drift.

